      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest? i don't know if i can call it that. it feels more like a burden. my doctor says i should stay active, keep fighting, keep \"engaging\"... but why? every day is just more of the same. harder to walk, harder to remember things. it's like being forced to watch a movie that's gotten boring and painful, but the credits just won't roll.",
