      "content": "closing my eyes doesn't change the fact that i'm still here. it's the lack of control that gets to me. i've spent my whole life making decisions, and now i'm just being told to sit here and let nature decide when i'm finished. it feels so undignified, just letting the engine stall out on its own. there's no dignity in just waiting to be taken away.",
